    {
      "parameters": {
        "descriptionType": "manual",
        "toolDescription": "=Use this tool to search and read sales data from the connected Google Sheets database. \n\nThe sheet contains transactional sales records with the following columns:\n- date: Transaction date (Format: YYYY-MM-DD, e.g., 2026-01-03).\n- city: City where the sale occurred (e.g., Cairo, Alexandria).\n- product: Specific product sold (e.g., Laptop, Laptop Bag, Wireless Mouse, Monitor, Headphone, Dishwasher).\n- category: Main product category (e.g., Accessories, Electronics).\n- quantity: Number of items sold in the transaction (Numeric integer).\n- unit-price: Price per single unit in local currency (Numeric integer/float).\n- sales_rep: Name of the sales representative who closed the deal (e.g., salma, alaa).\n\nUse this tool to filter by date, city, product category, or sales representative, or to retrieve quantities and prices needed for revenue calculations.",
        "documentId": {
